[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1908","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-8467","title":"趋势科技 Apex One 和 OfficeScan XG 迁移工具组件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Apex One 2019 和 OfficeScan XG 中的迁移工具组件存在远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞源于迁移工具在处理认证请求时的安全缺陷，未经充分身份验证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意请求在受影响安装上执行任意代码。攻击者需要先获得低权限用户凭证才能发起利用尝试，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，导致机密性、完整性和可用性均遭受严重影响。该漏洞影响 OfficeScan XG 12.0 及 Apex One 2019 14.0 版本，CVSS 评分为 8.8，危害等级为高。CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录，Trend Micro 已发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-8467"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-18T01:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:26:25Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Trend Micro 支持的最新版本：OfficeScan 12.0 升级到 12.4 或更高版本，Apex One 2019 升级到 14.0 或更高版本。下载并安装最新的安全补丁包，通过 Windows Update 或 Trend Micro 下载中心获取最新版本。如无法立即打补丁，请通过防火墙阻止迁移工具端口的网络访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://success.trendmicro.com/jp/solution/000244253","https://success.trendmicro.com/solution/000245571","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-8467","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-8467.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8467.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b7225b049fb11840df1a866370e432ba580ab817/2020/8xxx/CVE-2020-8467.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-8467.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-8467.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-8467.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-8467.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2020-8467.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2020/CVE-2020-84xx/CVE-2020-8467.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/1f6c0547e1150cfe37e80fafd5a77b9965a80719/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-8467.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1908.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-1908.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1509","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3950","title":"VMware Fusion、VMRC及Horizon Client 权限提升漏洞","description":"VMware Fusion、VMware Remote Console for Mac 及 Horizon Client for Mac 存在权限提升漏洞，其根本原因是产品中 setuid 二进制文件使用不当。攻击者在已拥有目标系统普通用户权限的前提下，可通过构造符号链接和恶意服务脚本，诱导 setuid 二进制文件以 root 身份执行任意代码，从而将自身权限提升至系统 root 级别。该漏洞影响 VMware Fusion 11.x（低于 11.5.2 版本）、VMware Remote Console for Mac 11.x 及更早版本（低于 11.0.1）、Horizon Client for Mac 5.x 及更早版本（低于 5.4.0）。成功利用此漏洞后，攻击者可完全控制受影响的 macOS 系统，执行任意系统命令、修改敏感文件或横向移动。VMware 已在后续安全更新中修复此问题，受影响用户应升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3950"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-17T19:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:19:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 VMware Fusion 到 11.5.3、VMware Remote Console for Mac 到 11.0.1、Horizon Client for Mac 到 5.4.0；若 Fusion 已升级至 11.5.2，仍需额外应用 VMware KB78294 补丁方可完全修复。通过 VMware 官网下载页面获取更新版本安装，并重启受影响主机。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156843/VMware-Fusion-11.5.2-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157079/VMware-Fusion-USB-Arbitrator-Setuid-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2020-0005.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3950","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48235","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3950.md","https://github.com/Marten4n6/EvilOSX/blob/033a662030e99b3704a1505244ebc1e6e59fba57/server/modules/bot/CVE-2020-3950.py","https://github.com/Marten4n6/EvilOSX/blob/033a662030e99b3704a1505244ebc1e6e59fba57/server/modules/server/CVE-2020-3950.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3950.json","https://github.com/mirchr/security-research/blob/55e737e8d8fa426863ef961793e0a263f70625b7/vulnerabilities/CVE-2020-3950.sh","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3950.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3950.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-3950.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-3950.md","https://github.com/b3tt3rlynx/CrackMacExpo/blob/a7b048a123cd5ddc0ea7ea673f12717b5351d8b4/src/server/modules/bot/CVE-2020-3950.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1686","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-5849","title":"Lime Technology Unraid 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Unraid 6.8.0 存在认证绕过与任意代码执行漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 Web 管理界面的路径遍历特性绕过登录认证，直接获取管理员权限。该漏洞结合不安全的 PHP extract() 函数使用方式，攻击者可通过向目标发送特制 HTTP GET 请求，构造恶意参数注入 PHP 代码并在服务器上以 root 权限执行，最终完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Unraid 6.8.0 版本，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高，且已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-5849"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:22:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Unraid 6.8.1 或更高版本以修复认证绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制管理界面（端口 80/443）的访问来源IP，仅允许可信网络访问，作为临时缓解措施。升级前请先备份重要数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157275/Unraid-6.8.0-Authentication-Bypass-Arbitrary-Code-Execution.html","https://forums.unraid.net/forum/7-announcements/","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2020-02-06-cve-2020-5847-cve-2020-5849-unraid-6-8-0-unauthenticated-remote-code-execution-as-root/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-5849","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48353","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5849.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5849.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-5849.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-5849.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-5849.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-5849.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2020/CVE-2020-5849.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2020-5849.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2020-5849.yaml","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/af6ad965aa812e5fb07e0e63d9b123f698246731/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-5849.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1686.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-1686.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1685","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-5847","title":"Lime Technology Unraid 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Unraid 6.8.0及以下版本的Web管理界面存在认证绕过与任意代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的`/webGui/images/green-on.png/`端点发送包含特制`path`和`site[x][text]`参数的恶意HTTP请求，绕过身份验证并在服务器端执行任意PHP代码。该漏洞影响部署Unraid操作系统的网络存储设备，攻击者无需有效凭据即可在受影响的系统上以root权限执行任意命令，完全控制文件系统、敏感数据及网络服务。CVSS评分为9.8，危害等级严重。Unraid已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-5847"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:22:19Z","remediation":"立即将 Unraid 升级至 6.8.1 或更高版本以修复该漏洞，可通过 Unraid 控制台的\"更新与恢复\"功能或访问 https://unraid.net/download 手动下载最新稳定版进行升级。同时建议在网络层面通过防火墙限制对管理界面（默认端口 80/443）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 地址连接，并在无法立即升级时临时禁用 Web 界面的远程访问以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157275/Unraid-6.8.0-Authentication-Bypass-Arbitrary-Code-Execution.html","https://forums.unraid.net/forum/7-announcements/","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2020-02-06-cve-2020-5847-cve-2020-5849-unraid-6-8-0-unauthenticated-remote-code-execution-as-root/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-5847","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-5847.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5847.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-5847-5190.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-5847-5192.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2020-5847.yaml","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Unraid/CVE-2020-5847/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2020/5xxx/CVE-2020-5847.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-5849.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/1b8036f6bf20f17e964eaec9897b470f15ef1f0c/2020/CVE-2020-5847.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-5847.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-5847.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0044","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0796","title":"Microsoft Windows SMBv3 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Server Message Block 3.1.1 (SMBv3) 协议在处理特制压缩数据包时存在整数溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 SMBv3 服务端口（445）发送精心构造的压缩 SMB 数据包触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞无需用户交互即可被利用，且具备蠕虫传播特性，影响 Windows 10 版本 1903/1909 及 Windows Server 版本 1903/1909。攻击者成功利用后可获取目标系统的完全控制权限，安装恶意程序、查看/篡改数据或创建新账户。Microsoft 已于 2020 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，补丁编号为 ADV200005。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0796"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-12T16:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:38Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 3 月安全更新（Windows 10 1903/1909 对应 KB4551762，Windows Server 1903/1909 对应对应补丁），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过 PowerShell 执行 `Set-ItemProperty -Path \"HKLM:\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\LanmanServer\\Parameters\" DisableCompression -Type DWORD -Value 1` 禁用 SMBv3 压缩功能作为临时缓解措施，无需重启。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156731/CoronaBlue-SMBGhost-Microsoft-Windows-10-SMB-3.1.1-Proof-Of-Concept.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156732/Microsoft-Windows-SMB-3.1.1-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156980/Microsoft-Windows-10-SMB-3.1.1-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157110/SMBv3-Compression-Buffer-Overflow.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157901/Microsoft-Windows-SMBGhost-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158054/SMBleed-SMBGhost-Pre-Authentication-Remote-Code-Execution-Proof-Of-Concept.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0796","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0796","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48537","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2020/CVE-2020-0796.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0796.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2020/CVE-2020-0796.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2020-0796/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2020-0796/README_EN.md","https://github.com/eerykitty/CVE-2020-0796-PoC/blob/197416b162f847c6042290c88fc5508d4facfa80/CVE-2020-0796.py","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2020-0796.cs","https://github.com/orleven/Tentacle/blob/bc01b3d0d2f9a6117132f40e9098a16180335454/script/vul/smb/CVE-2020-0796.py","https://github.com/saucer-man/saucerframe/blob/f7ea39f7f9deb6d73b64fc723c9783b14e2079f6/scripts/cve-2020-0796.py","https://github.com/kmkz/Exploits/blob/4fa8561c9e85b6657a915dc6295405b24ca57b71/2020/CVE-2020-0796_scan.sh","https://github.com/psc4re/NSE-scripts/blob/b9aa5cdc49d353707fecbf2bc42215b5c337c24c/cve-2020-0796.nse","https://github.com/danigargu/CVE-2020-0796","https://github.com/ly4k/SMBGhost","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation","https://github.com/jamf/CVE-2020-0796-RCE-POC","https://github.com/Barriuso/SMBGhost_AutomateExploitation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0033","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0787","title":"Microsoft Windows Background Intelligent Transfer Service 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 后台智能传输服务（BITS）存在权限提升漏洞，由于该服务在处理符号链接时未正确验证路径，导致攻击者可以利用符号链接劫持机制实现权限提升。本地攻击者通过诱使用户打开特制文件或访问恶意网站触发 BITS 操作，即可在目标系统上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码，实现从低权限用户到系统最高权限的提权。该漏洞影响 Windows 7 至 Windows 10 及 Windows Server 2008 至 2019 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即安装补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0787"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-12T16:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:36Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 3 月安全更新：Windows 10 v1909/v1903 安装 KB4540673，v1809 安装 KB4538461，v1803 安装 KB4540689，v1709 安装 KB4540681，v1607 安装 KB4540688，v1507 安装 KB4540693；Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4540688（需 ESU）；Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4540686。也可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。由于该漏洞已遭在野利用且被纳入勒索软件攻击链，建议优先安排补丁部署，无法立即打补丁的终端可限制非管理员用户登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158056/Background-Intelligent-Transfer-Service-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0787","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0787","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0787.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2020-0787/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2020-0787/README_EN.md","https://github.com/izj007/wechat/blob/3de7f7edc20777e0fb256eb204866383d42d5f2f/articles/[无级安全]-2021-9-13-CVE-2020-0787 Windows 全版本 本地提权.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0787.json","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2020-0787/README.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d2627ca1f15383a/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0787.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0787.md","https://github.com/k8gege/k8gege.github.io/blob/0562c0ddc0b76d93df268fcb4feea3f97fa3589d/p/lpe_cve-2020-0787.html","https://github.com/cbwang505/CVE-2020-0787-EXP-ALL-WINDOWS-VERSION","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation","https://github.com/yanghaoi/CVE-2020-0787","https://github.com/MasterSploit/CVE-2020-0787","https://github.com/MasterSploit/CVE-2020-0787-BitsArbitraryFileMove-master"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0099","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-10181","title":"Sumavision Enhanced Multimedia Router 任意管理员用户创建漏洞","description":"Sumavision Enhanced Multimedia Router (EMR) 3.0.4.27 的 goform/formEMR30 接口存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者无需任何认证即可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求（如 setString=new_user<*1*>administrator<*1*>123456）在设备上创建具有管理员权限的任意用户。攻击成功后，攻击者可完全控制路由器设备，窃取网络流量、修改网络配置或发起进一步内网攻击。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商尚未发布官方修复补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-10181"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-11T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:47:27Z","remediation":"立即将 Sumavision EMR 路由器固件升级至厂商提供的最新版本（如有）；若厂商已停止支持，建议更换为受支持的设备。作为临时缓解措施，在路由器管理界面禁用远程管理功能，并在网络防火墙层面限制对 TCP 端口 80/443 的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 地址连接。同时监控设备日志中是否存在异常用户创建行为（如通过 goform/formEMR30 接口的 setString 请求）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156746/Enhanced-Multimedia-Router-3.0.4.27-Cross-Site-Request-Forgery.html","https://github.com/s1kr10s/Sumavision_EMR3.0","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ufcj4D9eA5o","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-10181","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10181.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2020/10xxx/CVE-2020-10181.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2020/10xxx/CVE-2020-10181.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-10181.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-10181.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-10181.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-10181.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-10181.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-10181.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/a98b678de864d822449fa563f0932aa46fad56c0/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-10181.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0099.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0099.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0003","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0041","title":"Google Android Binder 越界写入权限提升漏洞","description":"Android内核中的binder.c文件内binder_transaction函数存在不正确的边界检查缺陷，攻击者可利用此漏洞触发越界写入操作。该漏洞影响Android内核，本地低权限攻击者无需额外执行权限、也无需任何用户交互即可构造特制binder事务数据包向目标系统发送，成功利用后可实现本地权限提升，从普通应用权限escalation至系统root权限，完全控制受影响设备。Google已在2020年3月Android安全公告中发布修复补丁，该漏洞已被CISA列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），野外已有实际利用记录。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0041"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2020-03-11T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Android 2020 年 3 月安全更新（安全补丁级别 2020-03-01），该更新已修复 binder.c 中边界检查不正确的越界写入漏洞。Pixel 系列设备可通过「设置 → 系统 → 高级 → 系统更新」检查并安装；其他 Android 设备请联系厂商获取对应安全更新。由于该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议优先完成更新，无法立即更新的设备应限制非必要应用的安装来源并避免授予可疑应用权限以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0041","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0041.md","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/b60e6fc0c88fc66528d7f9cfa8704cd63efc2c84/archive/j4nn/CVE-2020-0041.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/b60e6fc0c88fc66528d7f9cfa8704cd63efc2c84/archive/bluefrostsecurity/CVE-2020-0041.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/b60e6fc0c88fc66528d7f9cfa8704cd63efc2c84/description/bluefrostsecurity/CVE-2020-0041/description_en.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/b60e6fc0c88fc66528d7f9cfa8704cd63efc2c84/description/bluefrostsecurity/CVE-2020-0041/description_ko.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/b60e6fc0c88fc66528d7f9cfa8704cd63efc2c84/description/bluefrostsecurity/CVE-2020-0041/description_fr.txt","https://github.com/jiayy/android_vuln_poc-exp/blob/99d398a381cdbe12c0019075b8fa47b200e8a49f/android/EXP-CVE-2020-0041/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0041.json","https://github.com/evdenis/cvehound/blob/511f9c5ecf31bb64e38ca09449dda75c5c8c24e2/cvehound/cve/CVE-2020-0041.cocci","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/2ac59005f6e227f031caa7bd5f42ccb71cf13dd9/2020/CVE-2020-0041.json","https://github.com/bluefrostsecurity/CVE-2020-0041","https://github.com/j4nn/CVE-2020-0041","https://github.com/jcalabres/root-exploit-pixel3","https://github.com/vaginessa/CVE-2020-0041-Pixel-3a","https://github.com/koharin/CVE-2020-0041"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1688","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1688.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-6207","title":"SAP Solution Manager EemAdmin 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>SAP Solution Manager（用户体验监控组件）7.2 版本存在缺失身份验证漏洞。其 EemAdmin 服务未对任何访问请求执行身份认证检查，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接访问该服务的管理接口，通过发送特制请求完全接管所有连接到 Solution Manager 的 SMDAgent（SAP 托管代理），进而实现对整个 Solution Manager 系统的完全控制与远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有暴露在互联网或内网中的 SAP Solution Manager 7.2 实例，攻击条件极为宽松——攻击者无需任何凭据或用户交互即可远程利用，可导致敏感业务数据泄露、系统配置篡改及横向移动。CVSS v3.1 向量为 AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H，评分为 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-6207"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-10T21:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:22:52Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP 安全公告 SAP Note 2890213 发布的补丁，将 SAP Solution Manager 7.2 升级至对应 Support Package 的最新补丁级别：SP004 不低于 Patch 0012、SP005 不低于 Patch 0013、SP006 不低于 Patch 0014、SP007 不低于 Patch 0020、SP008 不低于 Patch 0016、SP009 不低于 Patch 0008、SP010 不低于 Patch 0002、SP011 不低于 Patch 0004。补丁下载地址：https://service.sap.com/sap/support/notes/2890213。如无法立即打补丁，临时措施为通过 SAP GateWay 或防火墙限制 EemAdmin 服务的访问源，仅允许可信网络中的 SMD Agent 通信，并禁用匿名访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161993/SAP-Solution-Manager-7.2-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162083/SAP-SMD-Agent-Unauthenticated-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/163168/SAP-Solution-Manager-7.20-Missing-Authorization.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2021/Apr/4","http: