:"2020/AVE-2020-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0069","title":"Android Mediatek Command Queue 驱动越界写入漏洞","description":"联发科（MediaTek）Command Queue 驱动中存在缓冲区越界写入漏洞，由于对用户空间传入的 ioctl 命令参数缺乏充分的输入校验，且缺少 SELinux 安全策略限制，导致攻击者可通过构造特制的 ioctl 调用在内核态触发越界写入。本地攻击者只需具备普通用户权限即可利用该漏洞实现权限提升，获取系统最高控制权，无需用户交互。该漏洞影响 Android 内核中的 Mediatek Command Queue 驱动组件，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Google 和联发科已在 2020 年 3 月安全公告中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0069"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-10T20:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:45:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 Android 2020 年 3 月安全更新（安全补丁级别 2020-03-01），该更新修复了联发科 Command Queue 驱动中的越界写入漏洞。华为设备用户应升级至对应修复版本，如 Honor 20 Pro 升级至 10.0.0.194(C636E3R3P1) 及以上、Nova 4 升级至 10.0.0.160(C01E32R2P4) 及以上。如无法立即打补丁，建议通过 SELinux 策略限制对 /dev/mtk_cq 设备的非授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.huawei.com/en/psirt/security-advisories/huawei-sa-20200527-01-mtk-en","https://source.android.com/security/bulletin/2020-03-01","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0069","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0069.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2020/CVE-2020-0069.md","https://github.com/jiayy/android_vuln_poc-exp/blob/99d398a381cdbe12c0019075b8fa47b200e8a49f/android/EXP-CVE-2020-0069/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0069.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0069.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0069.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-0069.json","https://github.com/wonderkun/crawler/blob/281e1d1564e073bd4c1322f63767c0f4fbfcf5eb/www.anquanke.com/CVE-2020-0069_联发科最稳定的 Rootkit 解构.md","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2020/CVE-2020-0069.json","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-0069.md","https://github.com/R0rt1z2/AutomatedRoot","https://github.com/quarkslab/CVE-2020-0069_poc","https://github.com/TheRealJunior/mtk-su-reverse-cve-2020-0069","https://github.com/0xf15h/mtk_su","https://github.com/yanglingxi1993/CVE-2020-0069"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0109","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-10221","title":"rConfig 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"rConfig 至 3.94 版本中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，位于 lib/ajaxHandlers/ajaxAddTemplate.php 文件中。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该接口的 fileName POST 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等），绕过输入过滤限制，在目标服务器上以 Web 服务权限执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响 rConfig 3.94 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。攻击者无需特殊前置条件，仅需低权限账号即可利用，已有公开的 Exploit-DB 和 GitHub PoC 代码，实际威胁较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-10221"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-08T22:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:47:30Z","remediation":"立即将 rConfig 升级至 3.95 及以上版本。如无法升级，编辑 `lib/ajaxHandlers/ajaxAddTemplate.php`，对 `fileName` POST 参数使用 `escapeshellarg()` 或正则过滤 `;|&|$|\\`` 等 shell 元字符；同时通过 Web 服务器配置限制对该文件的访问（如添加 `.htaccess` 拒绝规则），并在网络层面限制管理后台的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156687/rConfig-3.93-Authenticated-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html","https://engindemirbilek.github.io/rconfig-3.93-rce","https://github.com/EnginDemirbilek/EnginDemirbilek.github.io/blob/master/rconfig-3.93-rce.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-10221","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48207","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10221.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2020/10xxx/CVE-2020-10221.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5f7b2444b1b2b1b019b434748bbb88035c2136a4/2020/CVE-2020-10221.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-10221.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-10221.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-10221.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-10221.rules","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-10221.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-10221.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-10221.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0109.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0109.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0100","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-10189","title":"Zoho ManageEngine Desktop Central 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Zoho ManageEngine Desktop Central 10.0.474 之前版本中存在 Java 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞源于 FileStorage 类中的 getChartImage 方法在处理用户提交的序列化数据时未进行充分的安全校验，攻击者可通过 CewolfServlet 或 MDMLogUploaderServlet 接口向目标服务器发送精心构造的恶意序列化对象触发反序列化操作，从而在服务器端执行任意代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。该漏洞影响所有运行 ManageEngine Desktop Central 10.0.474 之前版本的系统，可能导致服务器被完全控制、数据泄露或勒索软件部署等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-10189"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-06T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:47:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 Zoho ManageEngine Desktop Central 至 10.0.474 或更高版本，该版本修复了 FileStorage 类中 getChartImage 方法对不可信数据反序列化的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置访问控制，限制对 CewolfServlet 和 MDMLogUploaderServlet 的未授权访问，并部署 WAF 规则拦截反序列化攻击载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156730/ManageEngine-Desktop-Central-Java-Deserialization.html","https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/502.html","https://srcincite.io/advisories/src-2020-0011/","https://srcincite.io/pocs/src-2020-0011.py.txt","https://www.manageengine.com/products/desktop-central/remote-code-execution-vulnerability.html","https://www.zdnet.com/article/zoho-zero-day-published-on-twitter/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-10189","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48224","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-10189.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-10189.md","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/ManageEngine/CVE-2020-10189/README.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5f7b2444b1b2b1b019b434748bbb88035c2136a4/2020/CVE-2020-10189.json","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-10189_Zoho_ManageEngine_Desktop_Central反序列化RCE_-_Y4er的博客.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-10189.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Zoho ManageEngine/CVE-2020-10189 Zoho ManageEngine反序列化RCE.md","https://github.com/bhdresh/SnortRules/blob/36aed344abdc19ad2edbbf933a0d368c0bda5d19/Exploit/CVE-2020-10189.rules","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-10189.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/Zoho ManageEngine/CVE-2020-10189 Zoho ManageEngine反序列化RCE.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-10189.md","https://github.com/WLDDTeam/WindowsDefualtServicesChecker","https://github.com/zavke/CVE-2020-10189-ManageEngine"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1700","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-6418","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 80.0.3987.122 之前的版本存在 V8 JavaScript 引擎类型混淆漏洞。攻击者通过向目标系统发送精心构造的 HTML 网页，可以触发 V8 引擎内部类型判断错误的漏洞，导致堆内存控制失衡，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows、macOS、Linux 等平台，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，只要用户访问恶意网页即可触发。漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，属于高危等级。Google 已在 Chrome 80.0.3987.144 版本中修复了此漏洞，建议用户及时更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-6418"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-27T23:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:23:18Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 80.0.3987.122 或更高版本，可通过浏览器菜单\"帮助\"→\"关于 Google Chrome\"自动检测并安装更新。如无法立即升级，可临时启用浏览器沙箱隔离机制，并避免访问未知网站，降低被恶意 crafted HTML 页面远程攻击的风险。同时建议启用 Windows Defender 或杀毒软件实时防护，拦截相关利用代码的执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156632/Google-Chrome-80-JSCreate-Side-Effect-Type-Confusion.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2020:0738","https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2020/02/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_24.html","https://crbug.com/1053604","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/6IOHSO6BUKC6I66J5PZOMAGFVJ66ZS57/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/X3B5RWJQD5LA45MYLLR55KZJOJ5NVZGP/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202003-08","https://www.debian.org/security/2020/dsa-4638","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-6418","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48186","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-6418.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2020/CVE-2020-6418.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-6418.md","https://github.com/anvbis/chrome_v8_ndays/blob/d8bb82a34ea13a6b054d4d2fb3ef040c03f60b01/cve-2020-6418.js","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-6418_V8_漏洞分析笔记_-_先知社区.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2020/6xxx/CVE-2020-6418.json","https://github.com/star-sg/CVE/blob/5975e9183ddc50f1ed825c3f0d5e9ea697774051/CVE-2020-6418/CVE-2020-6418-exploit.js","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Google/（CVE-2020-6418）Chrome 远程代码执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-6418.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-6418.md","https://github.com/Goyotan/CVE-2020-6418-PoC","https://github.com/ulexec/ChromeSHELFLoader","https://github.com/SivaPriyaRanganatha/CVE-2020-6418","https://github.com/ASkyeye/CVE-2020-6418"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1700.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-1700.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1508","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3837","title":"Apple iOS/macOS 越界时间戳写入内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple iOS、iPadOS、macOS、tvOS 及 watchOS 系统存在内存损坏漏洞，由于 IOAccelCommandQueue2::processSegmentKernelCommand() 函数对内存缓冲区边界内操作限制不恰当，导致越界时间戳写入。攻击者需诱导用户在受影响设备上运行特制恶意应用程序方可触发漏洞，成功利用后将获得内核权限并执行任意代码，完全控制设备。该漏洞影响 iOS 13.3 及更早版本、iPadOS 13.3 及更早版本、macOS Catalina 10.15.2 及更早版本等。Apple 已在 iOS 13.3.1、iPadOS 13.3.1、macOS Catalina 10.15.3、tvOS 13.3.1、watchOS 6.1.2 中修复此问题，CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3837"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-27T21:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:19:07Z","remediation":"将 iOS 设备升级至 13.3.1 或更高版本，iPadOS 升级至 13.3.1 或更高版本，macOS 升级至 Catalina 10.15.3 或更高版本，tvOS 升级至 13.3.1 或更高版本，watchOS 升级至 6.1.2 或更高版本以修复内存损坏漏洞。如暂无法升级，应限制设备本地物理访问权限并卸载不受信任的第三方应用作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/HT210918","https://support.apple.com/HT210919","https://support.apple.com/HT210920","https://support.apple.com/HT210921","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3837","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48035","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3837.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/13fb1730bf6abc50298c297920aeb0be1e9c9e55/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/iPhoneOS/Exploit/CVE-2020-3837.yara","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3837.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3837.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3837.md","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/iPhoneOS/CVE-2020-3837/Exploit_iPhoneOS_CVE-2020-3837_A_MTB.yar","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-3837.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-3837.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-3837.json","https://github.com/BrokenPorkMachine/B34ST/blob/f4b5602a1ba3cb1d1cc6f89afe06462855e57582/exploits/kernel/CVE-2020-3837.c"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0906","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0906.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-1938","title":"Apache Tomcat AJP 文件读取与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 的 AJP（Apache JServ Protocol）连接器存在文件读取与包含漏洞（Ghostcat）。由于 Tomcat 默认将 AJP 连接视为比 HTTP 连接更高信任级别，当 AJP 端口（默认 8009）暴露给不可信网络时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 AJP 请求包，实现从 Web 应用任意位置读取任意文件，或将任意文件作为 JSP 解析执行。若 Web 应用允许文件上传，攻击者可上传恶意 JSP 文件后通过 AJP 协议触发解析，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 7.x（至 7.0.99）、8.5.x（至 8.5.50）及 9.0.x（至 9.0.30）版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-1938"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-24T22:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:02:39Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 9.0.31、8.5.51 或 7.0.100 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 server.xml 中禁用 AJP Connector（注释 `<Connector protocol=\"AJP/1.3\"` 行）；若必须使用 AJP，添加 `requiredSecret=\"yourSecret\"` 属性并设置 `address=\"127.0.0.1\"` 限制本地访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-03/msg00025.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-05/msg00002.html","http://support.blackberry.com/kb/articleDetail?articleNumber=000062739","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r089dc67c0358a1556dd279c762c74f32d7a254a54836b7ee2d839d8e%40%3Cdev.tomee.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r1125f3044a0946d1e7e6f125a6170b58d413ebd4a95157e4608041c7%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r17aaa3a05b5b7fe9075613dd0c681efa60a4f8c8fbad152